@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Create a project
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plant model"
}

### List projects
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects
Accept: application/json

### Generate elements (replace projectId)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 10000
}

### Start validation (replace projectId)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/projects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/checks

### Inspect OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
